```</p><p><h3>Format Migration</h3></p><p><strong>Texture Formats:</strong>
<ul><li>Support legacy formats (TGA, JPG, PNG)</li>
<li>Auto-convert to modern formats when possible</li>
<li>Preserve originals for compatibility</li></ul></p><p><strong>Model Formats:</strong>
<ul><li>Support MD3, ASE, OBJ</li>
<li>Convert to optimized formats</li>
<li>Maintain source compatibility</li></ul></p><p><strong>Shader Formats:</strong>
<ul><li>Support legacy shader syntax</li>
<li>Auto-upgrade where possible</li>
<li>Document breaking changes</li></ul></p><p><h2>API Versioning</h2></p><p><h3>Engine API Version</h3></p><p>```c
